@50100005 = ~Advantages:
– Gains Arcane Tricks, giving the Trickster the ability to cast certain amount of Wizard spells per day. The amount of spells cast per day, and which spells able to be cast, are as follows.
 Level 1:
  Colour Spray, Magic Missile, Sleep, Spook, True Strike
  Gains one use at level 1, and additional uses at levels 3, 5, and 7
 Level 2:
  Blur, Glitterdust, Invisibility, Luck, Mirror Image
  Gains one use at level 4, and additional uses at levels 6, 8, and 10
 Level 3:
  Clairvoyance, Dispel Magic, Haste, Slow
  Gains one use at level 7, and additional uses at levels 9, 11, and 13
 Level 4:
  Confusion, Dimension Door, Greater Malison, Improved Invisibility
  Gains one use at level 10, and additional uses at levels 12, 14, and 16
 Level 5:
  Domination, Lower Resistance, Shadow Door
  Gains one use at level 13, and additional uses at levels 15, 17, and 19

Disadvantages:
– May only distribute 15 skill points per level (25 at level 1) among thieving skills.
– May not be lawful
– May not use Set Snare ability.
– -2 to backstab multiplier compared to an unkitted Thief:
  Level 1-8: x1 (no multiplier)
  Level 9-12: x2
  Level 13+: x3~ //Trickster: Kit Ability Block - Spell Revisions
@50100008 = ~Arcane Trick: Level 1
The Trickster can cast one of the following Level 1 Wizard spells:
 Colour Spray
 Magic Missile
 Sleep
 Spook
 True Strike~ //Trickster: Ability 1 Description - Spell Revisions
@50100010 = ~Arcane Trick: Level 2
The Trickster can cast one of the following Level 2 Wizard spells:
 Blur
 Glitterdust
 Invisibility
 Luck
 Mirror Image~ //Trickster: Ability 2 Description - Spell Revisions
@50100012 = ~Arcane Trick: Level 3
The Trickster can cast one of the following Level 3 Wizard spells:
 Clairvoyance
 Dispel Magic
 Haste
 Slow~ //Trickster: Ability 3 Description - Spell Revisions
@50100014 = ~Arcane Trick: Level 4
The Trickster can cast one of the following Level 4 Wizard spells:
 Confusion
 Dimension Door
 Greater Malison
 Improved Invisibility~ //Trickster: Ability 4 Description - Spell Revisions
@50100016 = ~Arcane Trick: Level 5
The Trickster can cast one of the following Level 5 Wizard spells:
 Domination
 Lower Resistances
 Shadow Door~ //Trickster: Ability 5 Description - Spell Revisions
@50100018 = ~Arcane Trick: Level 6
Extensive familiarity with magic has given the Trickster the abiility to cast the following Level 6 Wizard Spells:
 Improved Haste
 Mislead
 Pierce Magic~ //Trickster: High Level Ability Description - Spell Revisions
 
