@50800005 = ~Advantages:
– Gains Divine Acts, giving the Agent the ability to cast certain amount of Priest spells per day. The amount of spells cast per day, and which spells able to be cast, are as follows.
 Level 1:
  Armor of Faith, Command, Doom, Remove Fear, Sanctuary
  Gains one use at level 1, and additional uses at levels 3, and 5
 Level 2:
  Chant, Hold Person, Know Opponent, Silence, Slow Poison
  Gains one use at level 4, and additional uses at levels 6, and 8
 Level 3:
  Glyph of Warding, Invisibility Purge, Miscast Magic, Remove Paralysis
  Gains one use at level 7, and additional uses at levels 9, and 11
 Level 4:
  Cloak of Fear, Death Ward, Lesser Restoration, Negative Plane Protection
  Gains one use at level 10, and additional uses at levels 12, and 14
 Level 5:
  Flame Strike, Righteous Fury, Slay Living
  Gains one use at level 13, and additional uses at levels 15, and 17

Disadvantages:
– Alignment restricted to non-chaotic
– May only distribute 20 skill points per level (30 at level 1) among thieving skills.
– May not use Set Snare ability.
– -1 to backstab multiplier compared to an unkitted Thief:
  Level 1-4: x1 (no multiplier)
  Level 5-8: x2
  Level 9-12: x3
  Level 13+: x4~ //Agent: Kit Ability Block - Spell Revisions
@50500007 = ~Divine Act: Level 1
The Agent can cast one of the following Level 1 Priest spells:
 Armor of Faith
 Command
 Doom
 Remove Fear
 Sanctuary~ //Agent: Ability 1 Description - Spell Revisions
@50500009 = ~Divine Act: Level 2
The Agent can cast one of the following Level 2 Priest spells:
 Chant
 Hold Person
 Know Opponent
 Silence
 Slow Poison~ //Agent: Ability 2 Description - Spell Revisions
@50500011 = ~Divine Act: Level 3
The Agent can cast one of the following Level 3 Priest spells:
 Glyph of Warding
 Invisibility Purge
 Miscast Magic
 Remove Paralysis~ //Agent: Ability 3 Description - Spell Revisions
@50500013 = ~Divine Act: Level 4
The Agent can cast one of the following Level 4 Priest spells:
 Cloak of Fear
 Death Ward
 Lesser Restoration
 Negative Plane Protection~ //Agent: Ability 4 Description - Spell Revisions
@50500015 = ~Divine Act: Level 5
The Agent can cast one of the following Level 5 Priest spells:
 Flame Strike
 Righteous Fury
 Slay Living~ //Agent: Ability 5 Description - Spell Revisions
@50500017 = ~Divine Act: Level 6
Great piety to <PRO_HISHER> god has given the Agent the ability to cast the following Level 6 Priest spells:
 Blade Barrier
 Bolt of Glory
 Heal~ //Agent: High Level Ability Description - Spell Revisions
 
